            <ArticleTitle>Endometriosis and Ascites: A Strategy to Achieve Pregnancy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1104-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.jmig.2015.05.013</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">S1553-4650(15)00413-6</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Deep endometriosis presenting with ascites and preserved fertility is an unusual combination. This report describes a unique case of deep endometriosis and primary infertility, with a successful pregnancy after an optimal surgical approach and personalized ovarian stimulation protocol for in vitro fertilization, which shows the importance of a multidisciplinary approach in these patients.</AbstractText>
